(Save as otherwise provided in this Act or any other law for the time being in force, any person including an intermediary who,) Tj
T* (while providing services under the terms of lawful contract, has secured access to any material containing personal information) Tj
T* (about another person, with the intent to cause or knowing that he is likely to cause wrongful loss or wrongful gain discloses,) Tj
T* (without the consent of the person concerned, or in breach of a lawful contract, such material, shall be punished with) Tj
T* (imprisonment for a term which may extend to three years, or with fine which may extend to five lakh rupees, or with both.) Tj
